palnet
# `scripts/*`, not `scripts`: gitignore semantics never descend into an
# excluded directory, so a bare `scripts` makes the negation below dead and the
# build fails again with MODULE_NOT_FOUND.
# @baydar/ui-tokens' build runs `node ../../scripts/build-tokens.mjs` to emit
# tokens.css. Everything else in scripts/ is a CI gate Vercel never runs.
scripts/*
!scripts/build-tokens.mjs
tools

apps/*
!apps/web
!apps/web/**

packages/*
!packages/config
!packages/config/**
!packages/shared
!packages/shared/**
!packages/ui-tokens
!packages/ui-tokens/**
!packages/ui-web
!packages/ui-web/**

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
